{"4607390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aetherwell", "steam_appid": 4607390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and adventure through multiple biomes and encounter unique and dangerous creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, mine and hunt.  Grow your base, craft your armor and weapons and create tools to prepare for the dangers to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 4 distinct classes.  Choose the direct and fierce Warrior, the swift and crafty Rogue, the powerful Wizard or the resourceful Cleric, all with their own skills to perfect and weapons to specialize in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the masters around the world to help you train.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and adventure through multiple biomes and encounter unique and dangerous creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, mine and hunt.  Grow your base, craft your armor and weapons and create tools to prepare for the dangers to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 4 distinct classes.  Choose the direct and fierce Warrior, the swift and crafty Rogue, the powerful Wizard or the resourceful Cleric, all with their own skills to perfect and weapons to specialize in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the masters around the world to help you train.</p>", "short_description": "Aetherwell is a challenging survival action RPG for 1 to 4 players. Build bases and craft weapons and tools to adventure in a dangerous open world. Master melee, ranged and magical combat and unique class skills to slay monsters and save the dying and chaotic Aetherwells.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607390/108b174adec6f80898dba619a53c01ad88aadbfe/header.jpg?t=1777828878", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607390/aced3b1ae2c